# Docker builds install dependencies and generate artifacts inside the image,
# so host copies of these must never enter the build context. Besides being
# wasteful, copying them breaks builds run from a worktree where node_modules /
# generated are symlinks (COPY cannot replace a dir with a symlink).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/generated
.git
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/coverage
